name: Document Bootstrap Completed
type: Coordination/Response
description: >
  Response reporting that a bootstrap provider successfully started the
  requested logical document and made a running session of that document
  available to the requester or to the participant on whose behalf bootstrap
  was requested.

documentSession:
  type: SessionInteraction/Document Session Reference
  schema:
    required: true
  description: >
    Provider-neutral reference to the running session made available to the
    requester or to the participant on whose behalf bootstrap was requested.
    Its initialDocument identifies the requested logical document.
